``VoltageParameter`` from the SR560 driver has been renamed to ``SR560VoltageParameter`` and is now
exported from ``qcodes.instrument_drivers.stanford_research``. The parameter classes
``ChannelBuffer``, ``ChannelTrace`` and ``GeneratedSetPoints`` of the SR830 driver have been
renamed to ``SR830ChannelBuffer``, ``SR830ChannelTrace`` and ``SR830GeneratedSetPoints``. These
and ``SR86xBufferReadout`` of the SR86x drivers are only created by the drivers themselves and are
now private. The old names remain available from the deprecated ``SR560``, ``SR830`` and ``SR86x``
module aliases until those are removed.
